  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "10. Shooting Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "10.02",
    "summary": "The active player resolves shooting unit by unit, for whichever eligible units they want to use. A unit already on the battlefield qualifies unless it has been picked to shoot in this phase. Pick one such friendly unit, then pick a shooting type it is eligible for and resolve it: [Normal](vsdata:core-rule/normal-shooting), [Assault](vsdata:core-rule/assault-shooting), [Close-Quarters](vsdata:core-rule/close-quarters-shooting), [Indirect](vsdata:core-rule/indirect-shooting), or one found elsewhere.",
